  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signalling architecture of fast deployment emergency telecommunication networks to be used in a natural disaster</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signalling architecture of fast deployment emergency telecommunication networks to be used in a natural disaster</title>
